# Copy to .env.local and fill in from your Supabase project settings.
# Leave both blank to run against the built-in browser-local demo backend.
#
# URL: Project Settings → Integrations → Data API → API URL (without /rest/v1/)
# KEY: Project Settings → API Keys → the *publishable* key (sb_publishable_…),
#      or the legacy anon key on older projects. Both are safe in a browser —
#      row-level security is what protects the data, not the key.
#      Never put a secret / service_role key here: this file is bundled.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
